message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "o2ring-analyzer: command-line analysis of overnight pulse-oximetry recordings from consumer wearable oximeters"
abstract: >-
  A command-line tool for analysing overnight pulse-oximetry recordings exported
  from Wellue/Viatom O2Ring devices. Computes the oxygen desaturation index under
  both the 3% and 4% threshold definitions, performs event-level desaturation
  detection with onset, nadir, duration and recovery, and reports nadir SpO2 and
  time below configurable thresholds. Baseline and event-duration rules are
  documented so results can be reproduced or compared against other
  implementations.
